version                  version for task-board\\n\\nUse \\\"task-board [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3064,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 766,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
