sonCode`, list accessors).\n24|- `record.go` — `FidelityDispositionRecord` build/decode with the\n25|  four record rules (exact⟺empty reasons; non-exact≥1;\n26|  synthesized⇒null canonical; evidence presence for all rows).\n27|- `report.go` — `BuildFidelityReport` / `DecodeFidelityReport` for\n28|  the closed 29-member Fidelity Report 1.0.0: branch-exact\n29|  archive/target nullability, row ordering (source sorted, then\n30|  synthesized sorted, keys unique), derived counts/reason counts,\n31|  closed 26-kind / 8-type breakdowns reconciled per disposition,\n32|  closed 7-key byte map, policy map, and omit-self identity.\n33|- `decode.go`, `errors.go`, `doc.go` — delegated parse helpers,\n34|  `ErrInvalid` refusal identity, authority/reuse/bounds doc.\n35|\n36|Landed-owner touch (reviewed diff: +67/−1, purely additive):\n37|\n38|- `internal/clonebundle`: `CheckExtensionsClosed`,\n39|  `EncodeExtensions`, `OmitSelfDigest`, `EventKinds`,\n40|  `ContentBlockTypes`, `ValidContentBlockType` — one-line delegates\n41|  over tested internals.\n42|- `internal/environ`: `CheckReverseDNS` (new) + `CheckExtensions`\n43|  refactored onto it (one line, behavior-identical).\n44|\n45|Nothing else changed. No README/doctor/config surface (a library,\n46|not a command); no registry edit; no sibling contract.\n47|\n48|## AC coverage: 40 of 40 rows driven and measured\n49|\n50|`TASK-260830-2ya5le_conformance-matrix.md` (attached): 40 AC rows,\n51|each driven through a production entry by a named committed test;\n52|every gate row carries a directly-reddening narrowing (§A). The\n53|35-test suite (333 pass lines incl. subtests) is green with 97.1%\n54|statement coverage. Honest accounting: row 24 carries the\n55|byte-reconciliation stated bound (rows carry no byte measure, so no\n56|row reconciliation is expressible — keys + uint53 gated, bound\n57|proven by admission); rows 33–36 are admitted properties /\n58|cross-checks with no gate to narrow (disclosed, not waived).\n59|\n60|Key enumerations (oracles retyped from spec text, never imported):\n61|\n62|- Vocabularies: 7 + 5 + 5 + 19 members admitted; 24 + 17 + 15 + 27\n63|  refusal tokens plus empty plus 5 non-strings each refused with\n64|  literal codes; core/extension disjointness asserted per core code.\n65|- Record grid: 7 × {0,1,2,128,129} × canonical × evidence = 140\n66|  cells through both entries (35 admit / 105 refuse, first-fire\n67|  literals asserted).\n68|- Aggregates: counts 14-cell ±1 sweep; reason 6-cell sweep +\n69|  extra/missing/zero keys; event-kind 182-cell +1 sweep + 7 −1;\n70|  content-block 56-cell +1 + 7 −1; byte keys/values + 6 bad shapes.\n71|- Identity: test-side JCS recompute agrees; omitting any other\n72|  member disagrees; zero/flipped/non-digest claims refuse.\n73|- Member sets: 29 + 11 + 7 unknown + every-missing sweeps.\n74|- Bounds: 5 string bounds × edge/edge+1 × 2 entries + 512/513\n75|  multibyte; evidence 65536/65537 ×3 arrays; attestations 64/65;\n76|  forbid 128/129; rows 0/1/1000001 at entries + 999999/1000000 at\n77|  the factored gate.\n78|\n79|## Mutants\n80|\n81|`internal/clonefidelity/testdata/mutant_harness.py`: 62 narrowing\n82|rows + harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED control. Battery executed\n83|TWICE on the final tree, exit 0, 63/63 `ok:` lines each run (62\n84|KILLED + control SURVIVED), one raw log per plant per run\n85|(`mutants/run1/`, `mutants/run2/` in the archive). Shared gates\n86|carry one plant with a dual-entry killer; twice-implemented rules\n87|carry one plant per side. `N-disposition-route` and\n88|`N-reason-core-route` are the token-preserving attacks, killed by\n89|the behavioral oracle suites. `N-record-synth-canonical` is\n90|labelled single-member class. Zero gate survivors: the only\n91|SURVIVED verdict is the control, whose survival states that the\n92|harness observes outcomes instead of hard-coding kills.\n93|`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`, zero `__pycache__`/`.pyc` (verified).\n94|\n95|## Validation reran (this run, final tree)\n96|\n97|All 30 configured commands from `task-board.config.json`\n98|(`spawn.worktree_isolation.validation.commands`), exits observed\n99|firsthand (logs `cmds/cmd01.log` … `cmds/cmd30.log`; race gate as\n100|`race/race-A…I.log` + `pkg/pkg-clonefidelity-race.log`; every log\n101|carries its command line + output + exit):\n102|\n103|- 1 gofmt check: 0. 2 build: 0. 3 vet: 0.\n104|- 4 `go test ./... -count=1 -v`: 0 — 45 packages `ok`, 2862\n105|  top-level PASS (+35 new), zero FAIL.\n106|- 5 race gate: 0 in 9 bounded groups (45/45 `ok`, zero `DATA\n107|  RACE`; sessquery alone 550.1 s), each with `-timeout 25m`.\n108|- 6 cover gate: 0 — 45 `ok`; `clonefidelity` 97.1%,\n109|  `clonebundle` 86.7%, `environ` 92.4% of statements.\n110|- 7–23 fuzz gates (rpcwire ×4, scalar ×1, canonicaljson ×4,\n111|  secconftest ×8, each `-fuzztime=100x -parallel=1`): all 0.\n112|- 24 tracecheck: 0 (`acceptance_cases=155`,\n113|  `clauses_discharged=70/574` — registry untouched).\n114|  25 cataloggen `-check`: 0.\n115|- 26 linux build: 0. 27 windows build: 0. 28 JSON sweep: 0.\n116|- 29 `task-board validate`: 0. 30 `git diff --check`: 0.\n117|- Brief extras: `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet ./...`: 0\n118|  (`cmds/cmd-windows-vet.log`); importer set\n119|  (clonefidelity/clonebundle/environ/sessadapter/scalar): all `ok`\n120|  (`pkg/pkg-touched.log`); package logs `pkg-clonefidelity-v`\n121|  (333 PASS lines), `-cover` (97.1%), `-race` (`ok`, zero `DATA\n122|  RACE`).\n123|- Base vs candidate importer grid (matrix §C): moved classes none;\n124|  `clonebundle`/`environ` suites green before and after the\n125|  additive exports.\n126|\n127|## Bounds (sibling scope, not waived)\n128|\n129|Cross-artifact row coverage and source-evidence resolution need the\n130|manifests as inputs (no entry takes them); `byte_counts` values\n131|carry no row reconciliation (proven by admission over identical\n132|rows); core-derived booleans admit any value except the pinned\n133|archive rule; archive